 as a polished 3D render — dimensional forms, soft studio lighting, subtle materials — keeping the subject and composition."},{category:"extension",label:"Zoom out and expand the scene",labelId:"canvas.imageSuggestions.expandScene",prompt:"Zoom out from the reference image: extend its surroundings into a plausible wider scene, matching its style, lighting, and perspective, with the original content at the center."}],i=[{category:"extension",label:"Build this screen",labelId:"canvas.imageSuggestions.buildScreen",prompt:"Look at the reference image and use it as inspiration to build exactly one new design frame in the same spirit — a similar sense of structure, color, and typography — with original content that fits this app."},{category:"reimagining",label:"Riff on this design",labelId:"canvas.imageSuggestions.riff",prompt:"Look at the reference image and use it as inspiration to build exactly one new design frame that riffs on its strongest ideas — keep what makes it compelling but reinterpret it for this app rather than copying it."},{category:"refresh",label:"Make it more modern",labelId:"canvas.imageSuggestions.modern",prompt:"Look at the reference image and use it as inspiration to build exactly one new design frame that modernizes the idea — cleaner typography, more generous spacing, contemporary component styling — serving the same purpose for this app."},{category:"shift",label:"Restyle it, more avant-garde",labelId:"canvas.imageSuggestions.avantGarde",prompt:"Look at the reference image and use it as inspiration to build exactly one new design frame that takes the idea in a bold, avant-garde direction — experimental typography, unexpected composition, daring color."},{category:"extension",label:"Make another page of this app",labelId:"canvas.imageSuggestions.anotherPage",prompt:"Look at the reference image and use its design language — colors, typography, spacing, and components — as inspiration to build exactly one new design frame showing a plausible addit